course: dictionary
lesson: 2992
title: Dumb: more than one meaning
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word dumb has more than one meaning, so you need the words around it to know which one fits. Read the whole sentence before you decide.
explain: «A story told by a dog is not dumb: it shows the world from a new viewpoint.» Here dumb means stupid or silly. The writer says the story is not stupid, because it shows the world in a new way.
explain: «The poor mouse is struck dumb with stage-fright.» Struck dumb does not mean hit on the head. It means so frightened or surprised that you cannot say anything for a moment.
explain: Calling a person dumb is unkind. «Haha, you're so dumb» just makes someone go quiet. Choose kind words, and check that your meaning still makes sense in the sentence.
fact: In everyday talk, especially in the USA, dumb means stupid or silly.
fact: Calling a person dumb is a rude, hurtful word.
fact: In older English, dumb meant not able to speak. Today people say «non-speaking» or «unable to speak» instead.
fact: To be «struck dumb» means to be so surprised or frightened that you cannot say anything for a moment.
fact: «Dumb luck» means pure luck, and «play dumb» means pretend not to know.
exercise: «A story told by a dog is not dumb: it shows the world from a new viewpoint.» What does dumb mean in this sentence? | *Stupid or silly | Pretending not to know | Unable to speak | Very loud
exercise: «The poor mouse is struck dumb with stage-fright.» What does struck dumb mean here? | Happy to be on stage | *So frightened she cannot say anything for a moment | Hit on the head | Bored with the play
exercise: What does «dumb luck» mean? | Bad weather on the day | A dumb animal | Very clever planning | *Pure luck, with no skill
test: Which phrase means pretending that you do not know something? | Struck dumb | A dumb idea | Dumb luck | *Play dumb
test: Which words are the kinder choice for someone who cannot speak? | Stupid | Dumb | Silly | *Unable to speak
exam: Which reply is kind when a friend makes a mistake? | *Everyone gets things wrong sometimes, so let's try again | Haha, you're so dumb | Stop being dumb now | Who would be so dumb?
